      ],
      "source": "https://lewistownillinois.org/plan-your-visit/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every October, the Spoon River Valley Scenic Drive turns Lewistown into a two‑weekend festival of arts, crafts, and history.",
